~ start

match get_choice_count("paid_respect")
	when 0
		PLUM: The writing is impossible to read. (sad)
		PLUM: I can only make out the words "I didn't" and "Rosie".

		- Pay respect
			$> increment_choice("paid_respect")
			You pray for Rosie.
			=> END

		- Do nothing
			=> END

	else
		You've already paid your respects here.
		=> END